OL,3,ARetired US generals call on Pentagon to
OL,4,Acancel 'barbaric' execution livestream
OL,5,
OL,6,FA group of 72 retired US generals,
OL,7,Fadmirals, and other high-ranking
OL,8,Fmilitary officers are pressing the US
OL,9,Fgovernment to cancel plans to
OL,10,Flivestream an execution by firing
OL,11,Fsquad.
OL,13,F"We ask the President, our
OL,14,FCongressional representatives, and our
OL,15,Ffellow citizens to act to prevent this
OL,16,Fbarbaric abuse of authority," they
OL,17,Fwrote in a letter where they also
OL,18,Fargued the livestream would turn the
OL,19,Fmass killer into a "martyr".
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/39
